    <string name="create_help_title">How to build your itinerary?</string>
    <string name="create_help_intro">There are two ways to build your trip itinerary. Pick the one that fits you best.</string>
    <string name="create_help_import_desc">Great if you already have an itinerary in mind or found ideas somewhere — a blog, a video, a chat with ChatGPT.\n\nThe app generates an instruction text that you copy and paste into any AI. It returns the itinerary in the right format. Then just paste it here and you\'re done.</string>
    <string name="create_help_chat_desc">Great if you don\'t have an itinerary yet and want to build it from scratch by chatting with the app\'s own AI.\n\nThe AI already knows your destination, dates and lodging. You describe the trip (family, couple, friends…) and what you like to do, and it builds a personalized itinerary right in the app.</string>
    <string name="create_help_tip">You can skip this step and build the itinerary manually later, right on each day\'s screen.</string>
